    <briefdescription>
<para>Defines the position, rotation, and scale of an entity. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is the most fundamental component for any entity that exists in the world. It defines where the entity is located, how it is oriented, and its size.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Rotation is stored in radians for mathematical consistency. </para>
</simplesect>
